      "x": 1440, "y": 416, "width": 280, "height": 88,
      "text": "GNN encoder · GraphSAGE / GAT\nh(l+1) = σ(W · AGG(h_i, N(i)))\nL message-passing layers\nreadout: g = MEAN({h(L)})\nh(0) = segment / chord features",
